<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1</book>
  <para style="h">Tesaloniki Fɔlɔ Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tesaloniki Fɔlɔman</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TE</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Fɔlɔ Tesalonikikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Kitabu Fɔlɔ Tesalonikikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Tesaloniki kɛni tɛrɛ Romi mansa so le ri Masedoniya jamana rɔ, Kirɛki jamana tele kankan bolo maran fan fɛ. Talibidenba Pɔli nara ten wo so kɔndɔ a kelaya taama filana rɔ, a ka bɔ kɔrɔ Filipe so kɔndɔ. A ka lemɛniya mɔɔ doilu sɔrɔn ye, kɔni a ma mɛn na, baa Judiya doilu nara, mɛnilu tɛrɛ ma sɔn a ko ma. Wo rɔ, fɔɔ a ye bɔ ten Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ jonna. Wo le rɔ, a ka wa Bere so kɔndɔ (Keladenilu suran 17 kuma diya 1 haan 10). Tɔ la, a nara Korɛnti so kɔndɔ, a kɔfɛbila Timote ka wa se ye, a ka Tesalonikikailu koilu ɲafɔ a yɛ. Wo rɔ, Pɔli ka kitabu fɔlɔ nawa Tesalonikikailu ma. Waati do, a ka sɛbɛ Korɛnti so kɔndɔ. Lɔnninnailu ye a fɔla ko Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin de fɔlɔ sɛbɛra sani Isa kitabu yɔrɔ gbɛrɛilu, a ka a sɛbɛ ten fɔɔ san tan ni wɔrɔnwula ɲɔɔn Isa nayɛlɛ kɔrɔ sankolo rɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kibaro mɛnilu nara ka bɔ Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ, keladen ka sɛwa woilu la ko rɔ. A ka baraka bila Alla yɛ ka bɛn wo misali ɲuma le ma Tesalonikikailu ka mɛn yiraka jamana mɔɔ doilu ma. A ka a fɔ a ye a fɛ ka to fewu (suran 1 kuma diya 1 haan suran 3 kuma diya 13). Wo rɔ, a ka ii kawandi ko ii ye ii tunadiya, a ni ka jan to lemɛniya rɔ Isa ma (suran 4 kuma diya 1 haan 12). Wo kɔrɔ, ii ra ɲininkali kɛ mɛnilu lɔla ka bɛn mɔɔ faanilu ka bɔ saya rɔ a ni Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko ma, a ka woilu jabi (suran 4 kuma diya 13 haan suran 5 kuma diya 11). A ka a sɛbɛ laban sariyailu ni tuwaliilu le ma (suran 5 kuma diya 12 haan 28).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin koilu le ɲabɔla ka bɛn waati laban ko ma. A ye a fɔla lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ ten ko ii ye sereya bɔ, ka a lɔn ko waati do natɔ, «Ii wa to ten Maari tɔrɔfɛ habadan!» (suran 4 kuma diya 17).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Pɔli ni Silasi ni Timote le ka ɲin sɛbɛ ka a lawa an Fa Alla ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin Maari Isa la lemɛniya jama ma Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Alla ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baraka bila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />An ye baraka bilala Alla yɛ ai bɛɛ la ko rɔ waati bɛɛ an wa kɛ Alla matarala ai yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />An hankili ye ai la koilu rɔ an na Alla ɲakɔrɔ, an Fa Alla, ko: ai la lemɛniya baarailu ni ai la kaninteya baarailu ni ai la tunadiya mɛn bɔnin ai jii an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />N badenmailu, ai le Alla kaninteilu, an ka a lɔn ko Alla ra ai suwandi. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Ka a masɔrɔn an ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai ma, wo ma kɛ kuma dɔrɔn di, kɔni fɔɔ fanka ni Nii Sɛniman ni hankili latɛɛ dafanin dɔ. Ai ka a lɔn an tɛrɛ taamanna ɲa mɛn ma ai tɛma ai la ko kosɔn. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ai kɛra le andeilu ni Maari ladɛn mɔɔilu ri, hali ai ka tɔrɔ ba sɔrɔn, ai ka kuma lamira le sɛwa rɔ Nii Sɛniman ka mɛn di ai ma. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Wo rɔ, ai ra kɛ misali ri lemɛniya mɔɔilu bɛɛ yɛ Masedoniya jamana ni Akaya jamana rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ka a masɔrɔn Maari la kuma lajɛnsɛnni ai baraka le rɔ, a ma dan Masedoniya jamana ni Akaya jamana gbansan dɔ, kɔni ai la lemɛniya Alla ma, wo ko ra lɔn yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. Wo rɔ, andeilu mako tɛ a fɔ ko la butun. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ai ka an namira ɲa mɛn ma, mɔɔilu ye wo fɔla, a ni ai ka tubi Alla ma ka ai kɔnkɔdon jooilu la ɲa mɛn ma, ka Alla ɲenemaya ni tuɲa bato, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ka a Dencɛ na ko makɔnɔ ka bɔ san ma, Alla ra mɛn nawuli saya rɔ, Isa mɛn ye an kunkala Alla la mɔnɛ natɔ ma.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli la kelaya Tesaloniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />N badenmailu, ai jɛrɛ ka a lɔn ko an wa ai wara, wo ma kɛ fuu. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Hali an tɛrɛ ra tɔrɔya ni ɲakankatan sɔrɔn Filipi so kɔndɔ, ikomin ai ka a lɔn ɲa mɛn ma, an ka an wakali Alla ma, ka a la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai ma hali mɔɔ siyaman ka a kankan wo ko ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ka a masɔrɔn an na kililiilu ma bɔ fili rɔ wala kɔsɔ ko wala janfanteya, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Alla ra an kɛɲa fɛsɛfɛsɛ ɲa gbɛrɛ ma, ka a la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma karifa an na. An ye kumala wo ɲa le ma. An tɛ a fɛ ka mɔɔilu hɛnɛ, kɔni Alla mɛn ye mɔɔilu jusu fɛsɛfɛsɛla. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Baa ai ka a lɔn fewu, ko an ma ai labaara wuya matɔɔ kan fɛ wala ka nata ai la fenilu fɛ dokon dɔ. Alla le an sere ri. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />An tɛ gbiliya ɲininna mɔɔ si la, ai le wala do gbɛrɛilu, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenbailu le an di, an tun di se an donin lala ai kun ma. Kɔni, an kɛra le mɔɔ sabariniilu ri ai tɛma, ikomin denba tii ye a la den mamirala ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />An da ai kanin bakɛ, wo rɔ a diyanin an yɛ ka Alla la Kibaro Ɲuma lase ai ma, wo kelen tɛ, kɔni ka an nii fanan di ai la ko rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn ai tɛrɛ duman an yɛ haan! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />An badenmailu, ai hankili to an na tele ni an na su baara ɲin ɲabɔ ko. An ka wo baara gbɛlɛn kɛ le kosa donin kana to mɔɔ si kun ma, an wa kɛ Alla la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lasela ai ma waati mɛn na.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />An sere le ai ri a ni Alla, ko an tɛrɛ sɛninya ni telen ni fɛɛtanɲa le rɔ aile lemɛniya mɔɔilu tɛma. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Baa ai ka a lɔn ko an kɛni ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ yɛ le ikomin fa ni a denilu yɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />An ka ai fanka don, ka ai masabari, ka ai madiya ko ai tamanɲa ye bɛn Alla ma, ale mɛn ye ai kilila kosa ai ye don a la mansaya ni a la gbiliya rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Wo le ka a kɛ, an ye tola baraka bilala Alla yɛ waati bɛɛ, baa ai ka Alla la kuma lamɛn an na tuma mɛn na, ai ka a lamira le Alla la tuɲa kuma jɛrɛ la, ikomin a bɛnnin ɲa mɛn ma, mɛn ye baarala aile lemɛniya mɔɔilu tɛma. Ai ma a mira ikomin mɔɔilu la kuma. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />N badenmailu, ai ra Alla la lemɛniya jamailu ladɛn, mɛnilu ye Jude mara rɔ, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na mɔɔilu. Ai wara mɔɔilu ka ai tɔrɔ ɲa mɛn ma, Judiyailu ka woilu fanan tɔrɔ le wo ɲa ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Iile Judiyailu le ka Maari Isa faa a ni kelalaselailu, ka an fanan tɔrɔya bakɛ. Ii tɛ Alla hɛnɛla! Ii ye adamaden bɛɛ juu le ri. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Ii ye a fɛ le ka an dagbɛlɛn Alla la kela lase la siya gbɛrɛilu ma, kosa ii ye kisi. Wo rɔ, ii ye tola ii julumun de makafula haan ka dafa. Kɔni Alla la mɔnɛ ra ban sela ii ma.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ye a fɛ ka ii tuwa ikɔ tuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />An badenmailu, wula ra an mataa an ɲɔɔn na waatinin, kɔni an jusu mataanin tɛ ai la. An da karan bɛɛ kɛ kosa an ye na ai tɔrɔfɛ baa ai yen lɔɔ ra an mira haan! <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />An tun ye a fɛ ka na ai tɔrɔfɛ, a gbengben nde Pɔli ra karan siɲa fila. Kɔni Setana ka an da tiɲan. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ka a masɔrɔn yon di kɛ an jii ri a ni an na sɛwa kun di a ni an na kunnafulen tɔɔmasere ri an Maari Isa ɲakɔrɔ a wa na waati mɛn na, ni aile tɛ? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Aile le an na gbiliya ni an sɛwa kun di fewu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Baa an tɛrɛ ti se makɔnɔni kɛla butun, wo rɔ, an bɛnda a ma ko an ye to ɲalasuma Atɛni so kɔndɔ, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />an ka an badenma Timote lawa ai ma, mɛn ye an baaraɲɔɔ ri Alla yɛ a la Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase diya kosa an ye wa ai fanka don, ka ai lalemɛniya ai la lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Wo rɔ, aile mɔɔ si kana kɔndafili ɲakankatan ɲinilu la ko rɔ, baa aile ka a lɔn ko wo le latɛɛni an ma. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ka a masɔrɔn an tɛrɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ waati mɛn na, an tɛrɛ a fɔla ai yɛ ko an di ɲakankatan. Ai ka wo lɔn, wo le kɛnin. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Wo le rɔ, baa n tɛrɛ ti se makɔnɔnin kɛla butun, n ka Timɔte lawa ai ma kosa a ye wa kibaro sɔrɔn ka bɛn ai la lemɛniya ma, baa n silannin tɛrɛ ko Majuuwalila wa se ai lafilila ko do rɔ, ka an na baara to ai ma fuu rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Kɔni Timote bansan de nala an tɔrɔfɛ, ka bɔ ai tɔrɔfɛ. A ra ai la lemɛniya ni ai la kaninteya la ko kibaro ɲuma lase an ma. Ko, ai ka ai miri an na ko ma sɛwa rɔ waati bɛɛ, ko an yen lɔɔ ye ai la kosɛbɛ ikomin ai fanan yen lɔɔ ye an na ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Wo le rɔ, an badenmailu, hali an ye tɔrɔya ni ɲakankatan dɔ, ai la lemɛniya ye an sɛɛbɛ donna. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Baa ai ra an nii ladiya an ma, ni ai ye to Maari rɔ gben gben! <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Nba, an ka kan ka baraka bila Alla yɛ di ai la ko rɔ, mɛn di bɛn wo sɛwa jate ma mɛn ye an dɔ ai la ko rɔ Alla ɲakɔrɔ? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />An ye Alla matarala su ni tele gbiliya rɔ kosa an ye ai yen, ko mɛn dɛsɛni ai la lemɛniya rɔ, an di wo lakanbali.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Sisɛn, Alla, an Fa Alla, jɛrɛ ni an Maari Isa ye sila rabɛn an yɛ, ka wa ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Maari ye a kɛ ko ai la kaninteya ye wara ka sabati ai ɲɔɔn tɛma, a ni bɛɛ tɛma ikomin an ta ye ɲa mɛn ma aile ma. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />A ye ai jusu fanka don ɲa wo ma, kosa fɛɛ si kana to ai la sɛninya la an Fa ni an na Alla ɲakɔrɔ, an Maari Isa ni a la mɔɔ sɛniman bɛɛ na waati rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Taama ɲa mɛn ka Alla hɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Tɔɔ la, n badenmailu, an ye ai madiyala, ka ai jusu kɔrɔtu Maari Isa baraka rɔ. Ai ra a lɔn an fɛ ai ka kan ka taama ɲa mɛn ma, ka Alla hɛnɛ, ai jɛrɛ ye mɛn kɛla, ko ai ye janfa wo rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Baa ai ka a lɔn an ka jamariliilu mɛn don ai bolo Maari Isa tɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Alla sawo le ten, ai ye sɛninya, ai ye mase kaninkɛ la. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Ai kelen kelenna bɛɛ ye ai jɛrɛ faribanku mira ɲa lɔn sɛninya ni kunnafulen dɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Ai kana kunfan jalonyailu ko fɛ ikomin lemɛniyabaliilu, mɛnilu ma Alla lɔn. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mɔɔ si ti wala a badenma ma janfa rɔ wala ka bɔrɔkɔ don a bolo. An tɛrɛ ra a fɔ ai yɛ, ka a jaserema ai yɛ gben, mɛn wa ɲin doilu kɛ, Maari ri wo ko sara wo tii la. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn, Alla ma an kili ko an ye ko sɛninyabali kɛ, kɔni ko an ye sɛninya. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Wo le rɔ, mɛn wa a ban kuma ɲinilu mirala, wo ma a ban mɔɔ yɛ, kɔni a ka a ban Alla le yɛ mɛn ka a la Nii Sɛniman di ai ma.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Awa, ka bɛn badenmailu la kaninteya ma, ai mako tɛ wo sɛbɛli la, ka a masɔrɔn Alla jɛrɛ le ka aile karan wo kɛla. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ai ye wo le kɛla badenmailu bɛɛ yɛ Masedoniya jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. Kɔni an ye ai madiyala badenmailu, ko ai ye janfa wo rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Wo ye kɛ kunnafulen di ai yɛ ka to sabari rɔ, ka ai hankili to ai la koilu rɔ, ka baara i bolo la, ikomin an ka ai jamari ɲa mɛn ma, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />kosa ai taama ɲa ye kɛ gbiliya ri lemɛniyabaliilu tɛma, ai donin ti nala tola mɔɔ si kun ma.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa na ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />N badenmailu, an tɛ a fɛ ai ye to ko lɔnbaliya rɔ mɔɔilu la ko rɔ mɛnilu ra faa, kosa ai kana to sununni ikomin doilu, jii tɛ mɛnilu ma. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />An lani a la ko Isa ra faa, ka a wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. Wo rɔ, an lani a la, ko Alla ri mɔɔ faaniilu lana Isa fɛ, mɛnilu lemɛniyara a ma.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Awa, an Maari ye kuma ɲin de fɔla ai yɛ: Maari na waati, andeilu mɛnilu ye tɛrɛnna an nii la, andeilu fɔlɔ tɛ yɛlɛla fewu mɔɔ faaniilu ɲɛrɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ka a masɔrɔn, jamarili wa di kan nayɛlɛnin ba rɔ, mɛlɛka kuntii kan wa bɔ, Alla la buru wa fɛ, Maari jɛrɛ ri jii ka bɔ san ma. Wo rɔ, mɔɔ mɛnilu faani ii bilanin Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɔfɛ, woilu le fɔlɔ ye wulila saya rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Wo kɔ rɔ, andeilu mɛnilu wa to an nii la wo waati rɔ, an bɛɛ ri layɛlɛ woilu tɔrɔfɛ duru rɔ san ma jonna, an di wa Maari labɛn san ma. An di to Maari tɔrɔfɛ fanan habadan. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Wo rɔ, ai ye ai ɲɔɔn fanka don kuma ɲinilu la.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ai ye ai rabɛn Isa na waati ɲɛrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nba, n badenmailu, ai mako tɛ a la ko n ye sɛbɛli kɛ ai ma ko ɲinilu kɛ waati ni teleilu la ko rɔ, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />ka a masɔrɔn ai jɛrɛ ka a lɔn fewu, Maari na lon di kɛ ikomin son ye nala su rɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Mɔɔilu ye jususuma ni lakandannin la ko fɔla waati mɛn na, halaki ye jii ii kan wo waati jɛrɛ le rɔ, ka ii latɛrɛnna ikomin muso den sɔrɔn kɔnɔ wa wuli a la. Ii tɛ nala tankala wo ma muumɛ! <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Kɔni n badenmailu, ai tɛ dibi rɔ, kosa wo lon ye ai latɛrɛnna ikomin son. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ai bɛɛ kɛnin kɛnɛya ni tele rɔ mɔɔilu le ri. Su ni dibi ta tɛ andeilu ri. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Wo rɔ, an kana sunɔɔ ikomin doilu, kɔni an ye to an hankili rɔ, ka an jɛrɛ mira! <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Sunɔɔlailu ye sunɔɔla su le rɔ, dɔlɔ minnailu fanan ye ii minna su le rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Kɔni ikomin andeilu ye tele rɔ mɔɔilu le ri, an ka kan ka an jɛrɛ mira, ka kaninteya ni lemɛniya kɛ an sisi makandan fen di, ka an kisi ko jii kɛ an kun makandan kɛlɛkɛ fula ri. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Baa Alla ma an suwandi a la mɔnɛ kanma, kɔni ko an ye kisi sɔrɔn an Maari Isa baraka rɔ, Ɲenematɔmɔnin. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />A faanin ande le yɛ, kosa ni an faara, wala ni an tora an nii la, an ye to a tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Wo rɔ, ai ye to ai ɲɔɔn fanka donna, ka to ai ɲɔɔn nalemɛniyala, ikomin ai ye a kɛla ɲa mɛn ma ten.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawandili ni tuwali laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Nba, n badenmailu, an ye ai madiyala ai ye woilu gbiliya mɛnilu ye baarala a gbɛlɛnmanna ai tɛma, mɛnilu lɔni ai ɲɛrɔ Maari la ko rɔ, mɛnilu ye ai lalɔnna koilu la. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ai ye ii jate mɔɔ gbiliyaniilu ri kaninteya rɔ ii la baara la ko rɔ. Bɛn ye to ai tɛma.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />N badenmailu, an ye ai madiyala ai ye salawatenilu lali, ka tunnagboyaniilu fanka don, ka fankatanilu dɛmɛn, ai ye diɲa mɔɔ bɛɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ai kana sɔn ko mɔɔ si ye kojuu sara kojuu la, kɔni ai ye karan koɲuma kɛla ai ɲɔɔn yɛ a ni mɔɔ bɛɛ yɛ waati bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ai ye to sɛwani waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Ai ye Alla matara waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Ai ye baraka bila Alla yɛ ko bɛɛ rɔ. Alla sawo le wo ri ai yɛ, mɛnilu ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ai kana Alla la Nii Sɛniman datiɲan a la baara rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Ai kana nabiya kumailu lagboyaɲɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Kɔni ai ye ko bɛɛ fɛsɛfɛsɛ, ka a ɲuma lamara. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ai ye ai mataa kojuu su bɛɛ la.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Jususuma Alla jɛrɛ ye ai lasɛninya ai kɛɲa bɛɛ rɔ. Alla ye ai sɔnɔmɛ ni ai nii ni ai faribanku to fɛɛtanɲa rɔ an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na waati rɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Alla mɛn ka ai kili, wo sabarinin, a ri wo kɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />N badenmailu, ai ye Alla matara an fanan yɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ai ye badenmailu bɛɛ tuwa ye badenmaya tuwali sunbuli rɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />N da ai jamari sɛɛbɛ rɔ Maari tɔɔ rɔ, ai ye bataki ɲin karan badenmailu bɛɛ yɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />An Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina ye to ai bɛɛ fɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>